    {
      "id": 47030,
      "name": "TheJayMann",
      "username": "TheJayMann",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-28T17:19:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you have two copies of the card in play, you effectively have two powers in play.&nbsp; You can't use the same power twice, but you can use the power on the one card once, and then use the power on the other copy of the card once as well.</p>",
